&lt;p&gt;Strong experience building web applications with React.&lt;br&gt;
Proficiency in JavaScript and modern frontend development practices.&lt;br&gt;
Experience with HTML5, CSS3, and responsive design.&lt;br&gt;
Experience integrating REST APIs or other backend services.&lt;br&gt;
Understanding of component-based architecture, state management, and reusable UI components.&lt;br&gt;
Familiarity with Git and collaborative software development workflows.&lt;br&gt;
Ability to write clean, maintainable code and communicate effectively in a remote team.&lt;/p&gt;

