Experience building e-commerce, food-ordering, marketplace, or merchant dashboard applications.&lt;br&gt;
Familiarity with payment integrations and checkout workflows.&lt;br&gt;
Experience with Web3, blockchain applications, or cryptocurrency wallet integrations.&lt;br&gt;
Familiarity with loyalty programs, rewards systems, and transaction histories.&lt;br&gt;
Experience with automated testing and frontend performance optimization.&lt;/p&gt;

