Consumer experience: Product discovery, shopping carts, checkout, order history, preferences, reviews, and customer communication.&lt;br&gt;
Merchant experience: Product and service management, promotions, discounts, reviews, messaging, and advertising features.&lt;br&gt;
Rewards and payments: Frontend experiences supporting the ELO token, reward earning and redemption, and available payment methods.&lt;br&gt;
A growing ecosystem: A flexible user experience designed to support additional services as the platform develops.&lt;/p&gt;

